From: PonWrt developers <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] build: validate only the selected NPU image profile

The local builder now selects the HG5585F NPU profile and exports one
sysupgrade image. Limit post-build image validation to that selected
profile while keeping the full validation path available by default.

Signed-off-by: PonWrt developers <noreply@localhost>
---
--- a/scripts/validate-build.sh
+++ b/scripts/validate-build.sh
@@ -58,7 +58,11 @@
     exit 1
   }
 done
-for profile in native wed npu; do
+profiles=(native wed npu)
+if [ "${HG5585F_PROFILE:-all}" = fiberhome_hg5585f-ct-npu ]; then
+  profiles=(npu)
+fi
+for profile in "${profiles[@]}"; do
   case "$profile" in
     native) pattern='*fiberhome_hg5585f-ct-*'; flag= ;;
     wed) pattern='*fiberhome_hg5585f-ct-wed-*'; flag=--wed ;;
--- a/scripts/tests/test-workflow-paths.py
+++ b/scripts/tests/test-workflow-paths.py
@@ -16,7 +16,7 @@
 
 def source_validation():
     text = (RECIPE/'scripts/validate-build.sh').read_text()
-    return text.split('\nfor profile in native wed npu;', 1)[0]
+    return text.split('\nprofiles=(native wed npu)', 1)[0]
 
 
 def full_validation():
